ality, high detail on character, atmospheric depth in environment."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 796, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 797, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 803, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "type": "TextEncodeQwenImageEdit", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#6c6088", "size": [240, 200], "pos": [540.2000122070312, 0], "id": 447, "properties": {"hasSecondTab": false, "cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.3.50", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"prompt": true}}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "TextEncodeQwenImageEdit", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 23}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "links": [781], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#3f384f", "widgets_values": ["Japanese manga oversized eyes, anime moe face, American comic thick rough inks, flat cel-shading with no gradient, photographic realistic rendering, hyper-detailed pore texture, 3D render appearance, oil painting impasto, sketchy unfinished lines, uniform stroke width, harsh black shadows, over-saturated neon colors, grey muddy desaturated palette, mixed style zones (realistic face on comic body), filter overlay effect, loss of original composition, character identity drift, deformation of original pose, simplified chibi proportions, pixel art, clip art, watermark, text overlay, low resolution artifacts, blurry lineart."], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 790, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "vae", "link": 791, "label": "vae", "